About WPP Media

WPP is the trusted growth partner for the world’s leading brands. With exceptional talent, trusted data and intelligence, and world-class partnerships - all united by our pioneering agentic marketing platform, WPP Open - we help clients navigate change, capture opportunity, and deliver transformational growth. 

WPP Media is WPP's AI-driven media operating unit, bringing together media, data, and partnerships to deliver creative personalisation at scale. Connected through WPP Open and powered by Open Intelligence, clients see exactly where, how, and why their media investment is working.

For more information, visit wppmedia.com .

About WPP Media &nbsp;

WPP is&nbsp;the&nbsp;creative transformation company. We use the power of creativity to build better futures for our people,&nbsp;planet,&nbsp;clients&nbsp;and communities. For more information, visit wpp.com. &nbsp;

WPP Media is WPP’s global media collective. In a world where media is everywhere and in everything, we bring the best platform, people, and partners together to create limitless opportunities for growth. For more information, visit wppmedia.com. &nbsp;

At WPP Media, we believe in the power of our culture and our people.&nbsp;It’s&nbsp;what elevates us to deliver exceptional experiences for both our clients and each other. In this role, it will be critical to embrace WPP and WPP Media’s shared core values: &nbsp;

• Be Extraordinary &nbsp;by Leading Collectively to Inspire Transformational Creativity. &nbsp;

• Create an Open&nbsp; environment &nbsp;by Balancing People and Client Experiences by Cultivating Trust. &nbsp;

• Lead Optimistically &nbsp;by Championing Growth and Development to Mobilize the Enterprise. &nbsp;

Role Summary &amp; Impact &nbsp;

As an Associate Director, Sports Sponsorship at WPP Media, you will play a pivotal leadership role in developing and delivering integrated sports partnership strategies for Mazda. You will translate Mazda’s business, brand, and audience priorities into distinctive sponsorship platforms and activation programs that build meaningful connections with consumers, strengthen brand relevance, and generate measurable impact. &nbsp;

Serving as a senior day-to-day client and partner lead, you will guide sponsorship programs from strategic development and opportunity assessment through negotiation, activation, measurement, and optimization. You will collaborate closely with senior Mazda stakeholders, internal WPP Media teams, agency partners, sports properties, rights holders, talent representatives, and vendors to ensure sponsorship initiatives are strategically sound, creatively compelling, operationally excellent, and fully integrated into Mazda’s broader marketing approach. &nbsp;

This role requires an informed perspective on the evolving sports and entertainment landscape, a strong command of partnership strategy and activation, and the ability to lead complex workstreams with confidence. The ideal candidate is a collaborative, solutions-oriented leader who can connect fan passions to business&nbsp;objectives, influence senior stakeholders, and inspire teams to deliver breakthrough work. &nbsp;

Skills and Experience &nbsp;

Sports Sponsorship Strategy &amp; Development &nbsp;

• Lead the development of integrated sports sponsorship strategies and activation recommendations that advance Mazda’s business&nbsp; objectives , brand positioning, audience priorities, and broader marketing strategy. &nbsp;

• Translate consumer, cultural, competitive, and marketplace insights into clear points of view and actionable partnership opportunities. &nbsp;

• Assess potential sponsorship properties, platforms, leagues, teams, events, talent, and emerging sports opportunities based on strategic fit, audience relevance, activation potential, and&nbsp; anticipated &nbsp;business value. &nbsp;

• Develop business cases, investment recommendations, and sponsorship narratives that clearly articulate the role and value

