• Give marketing structured feedback on lead quality,&nbsp;events&nbsp;and campaigns. You see first-hand what converts and what does not, and that insight should shape where the next investment goes. &nbsp;

Keep the record straight &nbsp;

• Log every meeting outcome within 24 hours and link each opportunity to the meeting that originated it. &nbsp;

• Maintain&nbsp;accurate&nbsp;records of account activity and qualification in Salesforce - reporting and forecasting depend on it. &nbsp;

Grow &nbsp;

